#api call for finding square area
###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/square/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "side":12
}

#api call for rectangle area
###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/rectangle/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "length":10,
    "width":5
}

#api call for triangle area
###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/triangle/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "base":10,
    "height":5
}

#api call fro circle area
###
